tool.content_aware_move.name = ʻUnuʻi Fakatatau ki he Kakanó
tool.content_aware_move.description = Toho ha meʻa kuo fili ki ha feituʻu kehe pea ʻe fakafonu ʻa e ava ʻoku tuku aí mei hono takatakaí. ʻI he founga Fakalōloá, ʻoku fakalōloa ʻa e meʻá kae ʻikai ʻunuʻi.
