tool.magic_eraser.name = Meʻatamate Mana
tool.magic_eraser.description = Lomi ke tamateʻi ʻa e feituʻu ʻoku tatau hono lanú ʻi lalo ʻi he tuhu, ʻo fakatatau ki he ngofua ʻa e meʻangāué—ʻo hoko pē ki he feituʻu naʻe lomí, pe ʻi he Layer kotoa.
